 "$comment": "SSRM engine expression contract v1 — golden fixtures. `expected` is the CLIENT evaluator's output (coercions and all); ssrmExpressionContract.test.ts asserts it here, and the rangrez WASM engine must reproduce it byte-for-byte when phase T3 lands (Rust plan §12, binding constraint 3: one grammar, one parser, one semantics). `compiles: false` cases must be REPORTED untranslatable, never guessed. Rows use plain column names; `allRows` feeds the client evaluator's aggregate expansion where an `agg` case needs it.",
